message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this repository as below."
title: "Tire Design Copilot: code and results for the Tire Society 2027 paper"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ddcribeiro10-byte/tire-copilot-paper"
authors:
  - family-names: de Carvalho Ribeiro
    given-names: Diego
abstract: >-
  Reduced-order, physics-informed tread simulator, agent-orchestrated surrogate-assisted design copilot,
  benchmarks, and frozen results behind "An Agent-Orchestrated, Surrogate-Assisted Design Copilot for
  Replacement-Market Tire Lines: Framework and Reproducible Proof of Concept". The simulator is not
  calibrated against real tires.
